values to the length used.\",\"possibleValues\":[true,false]},{\"name\":\"bufferSize\",\"optional\":true,\"defaultValue\":8192,\"description\":\"Size of the buffer writer, in bytes. The value must be greater than `8`.\\n\",\"possibleValues\":[]},{\"name\":\"deferred\",\"optional\":true,\"defaultValue\":false,\"description\":\"Generates the output as a data stream when set to `true`, and defers the script's execution until the generated content is consumed.\\n\",\"possibleValues\":[true,false]}]},{\"name\":\"java\",\"binary\":false,\"extensions\":[],\"defaultMimeType\":\"application/java\",\"acceptedMimeTypes\":[\"*/java\"],\"readerProperties\":[],\"writerProperties\":[{\"name\":\"duplicateKeyAsArray\",\"optional\":true,\"defaultValue\":false,\"description\":\"Converts the values of duplicate keys in an object to a single array of values to the duplicated key.\",\"possibleValues\":[true,false]},{\"name\":\"writeAttributes\",\"optional\":true,\"defaultValue\":false,\"description\":\"Converts attributes of a key into child key-value pairs of that key. The attribute key name starts with &#64;.\",\"possibleValues\":[true,false]}]},{\"name\":\"protobuf\",\"binary\":false,\"extensions\":[\".protobuf\",\".pb\"],\"defaultMimeType\":\"application/protobuf\",\"acceptedMimeTypes\":[\"application/protobuf\",\"application/x-protobuf\"],\"readerProperties\":[{\"name\":\"bufferSize\",\"optional\":true,\"defaultValue\":8192,\"description\":\"Size of the buffer writer, in bytes. The value must be greater than `8`.\\n\",\"possibleValues\":[]},{\"name\":\"deferred\",\"optional\":true,\"defaultValue\":false,\"description\":\"Generates the output as a data stream when set to `true`, and defers the script's execution until the generated content is consumed.\\n\",\"possibleValues\":[true,false]},{\"name\":\"descriptorUrl\",\"optional\":false,\"defaultValue\":\"\",\"description\":\"The URL for the ProtoBuf descriptor. Valid values are `classpath://`, `file://`, or `http://`.\",\"possibleVal